# Python

- Python 3.13, Ruff line length 120, src layout. Tests live next to the package, not in `src/`.
- `packages/domain` imports no FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Celery, or HTTP.
- Routers parse Pydantic, call a service, map `AppError`. No SQL and no LLM calls in a router.
- Read settings from `EnvironmentConfig`, not `os.getenv`.
- JSON via `ApiModel` is camelCase; IELTS criterion keys stay snake_case.
- Do not swallow exceptions with `pass`. Log at an external boundary, then continue or raise.
- Do not widen Ruff `select` in a feature PR. Do not add `Any` to hide a missing type.
- New behaviour needs a pytest. Live provider calls use `@pytest.mark.eval_live`.
